=== Replica host pin ===
  GIT_SYNC_REPLICA_HOST=replica.example.net:443 (from this process's environment)
  The connector pushes only to this host and rejects any configuration naming another.

=== Configured git-sync providers ===
  (none)

=== Repository sync state ===
  REPOSITORY  LAST ATTEMPT  LAST SUCCESS  DURATION  REFS PUSHED  NEWEST ORIGIN COMMIT  ORIGIN DEFAULT BRANCH
  repo-alpha  30s ago       29s ago       1.5s      3            1h ago                main
  repo-beta   1h ago        5d ago        800ms     0            -                     trunk
  repo-delta  -             never         -         -            -                     -
  repo-gamma  2m ago        never         120ms     -            -                     -

  As last recorded by the connector after each finished attempt: it can lag by a few seconds, omits
  attempts in progress and repositories not yet attempted, and may list repositories no longer
  configured. LAST SUCCESS is kept across failed attempts, so a LAST ATTEMPT later than it means the
  latest attempt did not succeed.

Enrollment status and failure reasons are visible in the Memento portal.
